    "text": "<p>Plotting the diagram of the given data we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0031_c5792804d8ae.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 267px;\"/></p><p>Area of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>△</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, equation of line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfence